  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/04/IMG_5833.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">El grup de can&ccedil;&oacute; infantil Trobadorets ha omplit la vesprada d&#39;aquest dimecres de m&uacute;sica, amb motiu del Dia del Llibre, La Repro d&#39;Onda, que tamb&eacute; ha descomptat un 5% en el preu de cada exemplar.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadoretslareprodiallibre14/img_5807.jpg\" alt=\"img_5807\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadoretslareprodiallibre14/img_5809.jpg\" alt=\"img_5809\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadoretslareprodiallibre14/img_5811.jpg\" alt=\"img_5811\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadoretslareprodiallibre14/img_5812.jpg\" alt=\"img_5812\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadoretslareprodiallibre14/img_5813.jpg\" alt=\"img_5813\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadoretslareprodiallibre14/img_5814.jpg\" alt=\"img_5814\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadoretslareprodiallibre14/img_5815.jpg\" alt=\"img_5815\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadoretslareprodiallibre14/img_5817.jpg\" alt=\"img_5817\" style=\"max-width:100%;h